Why GPL-3.0
-----------
The desktop client is free and is meant to stay free. GPL-3.0 keeps it that
way: anyone may use, study, change and redistribute it, and any redistributed
change comes back under the same licence — so a closed-source re-skin of
MailOh is not possible.

